documentation_complete: true

title: 'SSH Server Defaults Count as Compliant'

description: |-
    Whether an SSH server option that the configuration leaves out counts as
    compliant when the default of sshd meets the requirement. The CIS Benchmarks
    read the effective configuration with sshd -T, which shows these defaults.

type: boolean

operator: equals

interactive: false

options:
    default: false
    false: false
    true: true
